### 1. CASCADE PERSIST: save a category together with two products (needs an existing supplier id, here 1)
POST http://localhost:8085/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Books",
  "description": "All books",
  "products": [
    { "name": "Novel",    "price": 9.90,  "stock_quantity": 10, "supplier_id": 1 },
    { "name": "Cookbook", "price": 19.90, "stock_quantity": 5,  "supplier_id": 1 }
  ]
}

### 2. LAZY LOADING: the category JSON contains no products; they are fetched only by this call
### (replace 7 with the id returned by step 1)
GET http://localhost:8085/v1/categories/7
###
GET http://localhost:8085/v1/categories/7/products

### 3. CASCADE REMOVE: delete the category ...
DELETE http://localhost:8085/v1/categories/7

### ... and check that its products are gone too
GET http://localhost:8085/v1/products?category_id=7
